Nahual is a horror film directed by Ricardo Islas.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Katia Montero's exotic getaway spirals into terror when she
becomes possessed by a bloodthirsty animal spirit.

3
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Erotic encounters, violence, and ancient legends converge to
deliver a chilling new twist on a South American myth.

