8
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
I Am Frankelda (Spanish: Soy Frankelda) is a 2025 Mexican stop motion animated
musical dark fantasy film written and directed by Arturo and Roy Ambriz.

9
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
It is a prequel to the television series Frankelda's Book of Spooks, becoming the first Mexican film made
entirely in stop-motion technique, and features the voices of Mireya Mendoza, Arturo Mercado Jr.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
and Luis Leonardo Suárez.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
The plot follows Francisca Imelda, a young aspiring writer in the mid 19th century Mexico and her struggles to
fullfil her dreams after being approached by a prince who needs her help to save his kingdom.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
I Am Frankelda had its world premiere as the opening film of the 40th Guadalajara International Film Festival on
June 6, 2025, as well as competing in the Best International Animation Feature Film category.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
